10.7.4 For Travelling Cranes
a) The travel tracks shall be perfectly levelled both longitudinally and transversally;
b) The gauge shall be constant and the rail tracks perfectly straight and with the same shape along the entire path;
c) The rail tracks shall be placed on a solid base;
