1) Heat strengthened;
2) Toughened or tempered;
3) Double glazed unit;
4) Laminated glass (single laminated);
5) Laminated double glass unit;
6) Ceramic/screen printed fritted glass (patterned glass);
and 7) Fire safety glass.
